8. CONTINUOUS EVALUATION

The workbook has a separate formula:

continuousEvaluation = internalMark / 30 * 100

IMPORTANT:

Do not replace this with the 150-based CO formula.

They are two different metrics.

Example:

Internal Mark = 38

Continuous Evaluation
= 38 / 30 * 100
= 126.6667

The application must reproduce this behavior.

9. CLASS CO ATTAINMENT

For each CO1–CO5 calculate:

studentsAttained =
number of students where
55 <= CO <= 100

Equivalent logic:

COUNTIFS(CO_RANGE, ">=55", CO_RANGE, "<=100")

