12. CO ATTAINMENT LEVEL

For CO1–CO5:

if percentage > 75 => level 3
else if percentage > 65 => level 2
else if percentage > 55 => level 1
else => no attainment

IMPORTANT:
The workbook uses strict > comparisons.

Therefore:

76 -> 3
75 -> 2
66 -> 2
65 -> 1
56 -> 1
55 -> no attainment

